DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
     Use the xxoo__sseett__ssttyyllee() function to set the output style for a handle.  To
     use the default handle, pass a NULL handle.  The set of output styles
     used by lliibbxxoo is:

     FFllaagg          DDeessccrriippttiioonn
     XO_STYLE_TEXT  Traditional text output
     XO_STYLE_XML   XML encoded data
     XO_STYLE_JSON  JSON encoded data
     XO_STYLE_HTML  HTML encoded data

     The xxoo__sseett__ssttyyllee__nnaammee() function can be used to set the style based on a
     name encoded as a string.  The name can be any of the styles: "text",
     "xml", "json", or "html".

               EXAMPLE:
                   xo_set_style_name(NULL, "html");

